  "notes": "A collector's edition of the federation's own magazine programme, previewing the eight-match Last Stand card at the Alamo Dome in San Antonio and framing it as the end of a chapter in e-wrestling history. It was not: two documents nine and seventeen days later record a change of ownership rather than a closure. Its match previews replay footage from two earlier cards, the first USeW JAM and the Holiday Rush, both gap-registered here and neither held; replayed footage earns no appearance on this broadcast."
